<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Texas Instruments Inc to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept Texas Instruments as an intermediate accumulate.</p>
</text>
